    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Assured Judgment of the Wicked"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "To the Chief Musician. Set to “Do Not Destroy.” A Michtam of David when Saul sent men, and they watched the house in order to kill him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Deliver me from my enemies, O my God;",
          "Defend me from those who rise up against me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Deliver me from the workers of iniquity,",
          "And save me from bloodthirsty men."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For look, they lie in wait for my life;",
          "The mighty gather against me,",
          "Not for my transgression nor for my sin, O Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They run and prepare themselves through no fault of mine.",
          "Awake to help me, and behold!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You therefore, O Lord God of hosts, the God of Israel,",
          "Awake to punish all the nations;",
          "Do not be merciful to any wicked transgressors."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "At evening they return,",
          "They growl like a dog,",
          "And go all around the city."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Indeed, they belch with their mouth;",
          "Swords are in their lips;",
          "For they say, “Who hears?”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But You, O Lord, shall laugh at them;",
          "You shall have all the nations in derision."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will wait for You, O You his Strength;",
          "For God is my defense."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My God of mercy shall come to meet me;",
          "God shall let me see my desire on my enemies."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Do not slay them, lest my people forget;",
          "Scatter them by Your power,",
          "And bring them down,",
          "O Lord our shield."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the sin of their mouth and the words of their lips,",
          "Let them even be taken in their pride,",
          "And for the cursing and lying which they speak."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Consume them in wrath, consume them,",
          "That they may not be;",
          "And let them know that God rules in Jacob",
          "To the ends of the earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And at evening they return,",
          "They growl like a dog,",
          "And go all around the city."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They wander up and down for food,",
          "And howl if they are not satisfied."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But I will sing of Your power;",
          "Yes, I will sing aloud of Your mercy in the morning;",
          "For You have been my defense",
          "And refuge in the day of my trouble."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "To You, O my Strength, I will sing praises;",
          "For God is my defense,",
          "My God of mercy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
